•    •    •

Greetings, Captains!

On December 23rd, we released a small patch for Black Skylands.

- BALANCE -
- Boss on Moth Island is now more fireproof.

- UI -
- You now can see quantity of Data- and Energycrystalls above the crates.

- LEVEL DESIGN -
- Visuals for West Aspya islands were improved.

- BUGS -
- Eve's Power Shileld no longer blocks lasersight beam;
- Fixed random islands in South Aspya;
- Fixed bug in Moth Nest causing the "Training Cargo" item remain after completing the "Training Luma" quest;
- Volcano-islands now dissapear correctly;
- Pausing the game during the fight with Kraken no longer results in no loot dropped after defeating the monster;
- Krakengeist was nerfed: Kraken no longer controls the weather after his death, so it should return to normal now after you finish the battle;
- No more boosts for your ship in case she is pulled by the Kraken;
- Power Shield no longer outshines Eve: the glow was tuned down.


--------------------

MERRY CHRISTMAS!

